 concern on the strength of its investment portfolio while it explores new business opportunities."},"products":[],"endMarkets":"Steel industry (Ferro Silicon consumption)","currentContext":{"business":"The Company was primarily engaged in the manufacture and sale of Ferro Silicon at its plant in Byrnihat, Meghalaya. Operations at the plant were closed from 7th May 2025 due to a significant increase in power tariffs that made the operations economically unviable, and shareholders have since approved disposal of the plant, machinery and undertaking. The Company continues as a going concern on the strength of its investment portfolio while it explores new business opportunities.","products":{},"end_markets":{},"plants":{},"promoters":{},"board":{},"related":[{"name":"Suhag Overseas Trading Private Limited","relation":"related party","note":"Enterprise owned/influenced by Key Managerial Personnel; counterparty for interest received/receivable transactions with the Company."}],"strengths":{},"strategies":{},"expansion":"","mdna":{},"risks":{},"as_of":"","concallIntel":{}},"topics":{"one_liner":{"title":"One Liner (RHP)","body":"Shyam Century Ferrous Limited is a Meghalaya-based ferro alloys manufacturer that has discontinued its sole operating segment and is evaluating alternative business opportunities.","src":"drhp","as_of":""},"business_model":{"title":"Business (RHP)","body":"The Company was primarily engaged in the manufacture and sale of Ferro Silicon at its plant in Byrnihat, Meghalaya. Operations at the plant were closed from 7th May 2025 due to a significant increase in power tariffs that made the operations economically unviable, and shareholders have since approved disposal of the plant, machinery and undertaking. The Company continues as a going concern on the strength of its investment portfolio while it explores new business opportunities.","src":"drhp","as_of":""},"group_structure":{"title":"Related (RHP)","body":"- **Suhag Overseas Trading Private Limite