con Metal and Ferro Silicon adversely affecting international prices and causing realizations to fall below sustainable production cost levels.\n- Indian Ferro Silicon manufacturers, especially units in states with high industrial power tariffs, face significant competitive pressure versus producers in countries with access to low-cost hydroelectric power such as Bhutan.\n- India's dependence on imports for several critical raw materials used across the steel value chain exposed the Company to elevated international prices and freight costs.","src":"drhp","as_of":""},"strategy":{"title":"Strategies (RHP)","body":"- Evaluating opportunities across businesses that complement the Company's strategic capabilities and offer potential for long-term value creation, with the objective of building a diversified and resilient platform that reduces dependence on a single operating segment.\n- Assessing various strategic alternatives for optimising the asset portfolio and enhancing operational and financial flexibility, including business restructuring and diversification into new business opportunities using proceeds from the sell-off of assets.","src":"drhp","as_of":""}},"scorecard":{"symbol":"SHYAMCENT","fin_source":"shadow ledger (per-field legacy fallback)","fy_asof":"2026-03-31","opm_basis":"TTM 4q","opm_ttm":"-648.85","roe":"-5.54","roce":"-7.55","bq_a":"0","sales_cagr_3y":"-50.16538056441762","eps_cagr_3y":"","bq_b":"0","debt_equity":"0.0","interest_cover":"-113.09090909090911","bq_c":"8","cfo_pat_3y":"","wc_basis":"WC/sales trend","bq_d":"5","share_cagr_3y":"0.004712979552690122","bq_e":"4","shp_asof":"2026-06-30","promoter_pct":"49.65","promoter_prev":"49.44","pledge_basis":"pledge not in snapshot -> 0 penalty (hook)","piotroski_basis":"needs 2 FYs of BS_* -> 0 (real from FY27)","bq_f":"2","g_integrity":"5","g_execution":"0","g_capalloc":"0","g_basis":"defaults (no WTT/ledger coverage)","bq_g":"5","bq_total":"24","bq_gate":"False","stage2":"False","sector_on":"True","